{"id":"wb-4-25","name":"吴城遗址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"吴城遗址","text":"吴城遗址位于中国江西省樟树市吴城乡吴城村，1996年被列为第四批全国重点文物保护单位。\n吴城遗址于1973年秋季发现，遗址四周有残缺土墙环绕，总面积61.3平方米，自1974年开始对该遗址进行过9次考古发掘，证实在其周围约4平方千米的范围内有商周时期文化堆积，厚约0.5～2米。吴城遗址是长江以南首次发现的大规模商代人类居住遗址。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%90%B4%E5%9F%8E%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80","revisionId":86408579,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86408579","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/4acf8c8072d65b407b26fdd4.jpg","title":"National_Museum_of_China_2014.02.01_15-28-00.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:National_Museum_of_China_2014.02.01_15-28-00.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/48/National_Museum_of_China_2014.02.01_15-28-00.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Zhangzhugang","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"中国国家博物馆——\n\n原始瓷罐，商，1973年江西清江吴城出土","width":320,"height":213}}